9. Default Parameter vs Default Constructor — Professional Table
| **Basis**        | **Default Parameter**                               | **Default Constructor**                                          |
| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Definition**   | A predefined value assigned to a function parameter | A constructor that can be called without arguments               |
| **Used In**      | Functions and constructors                          | Classes                                                          |
| **Purpose**      | Provides an optional/default argument               | Initializes an object when no constructor arguments are supplied |
| **Syntax**       | `void show(int x = 10);`                            | `Student();`                                                     |
